<title>JAPAN: Tenmaya Store -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tenmaya Store -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to August 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    46.68		vs	   43.17</p>
<p> Operating	    1.13		vs	    1.10</p>
<p> Current	    569    million    vs	  375    million</p>
<p> Net		  283    million    vs	  450    million</p>
<p> EPS		   24.54 yen	  vs	   38.96 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     12 million	  vs	  12 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tenmaya Store Co Ltd is a supermarket operator.</p>
</text>
